          "status": "investigating",
          "updated_at": "2026-09-18T23:22:34Z"
        },
        {
          "body": "We’re investigating an issue causing higher-than-expected charges for OpenAI-hosted containers in the Agent API.\n\nWe’re working on a fix and preparing refunds for affected customers. We’ll share further updates as we make progress.",
